RegionGrow3D — Python port + Streamlit Web UI
==============================================

This repository is **dual-licensed**.

Most of the source is dedicated to the public domain via Creative Commons
Zero 1.0 Universal (CC0-1.0), preserving the licensing of the upstream
USGS RegionGrow3D code (https://code.usgs.gov/ghsc/lhp/regiongrow3d).

A subset of the preprocessing module is derived from TopoToolbox
(W. Schwanghart, https://github.com/wschwanghart/topotoolbox) and is
therefore licensed under GNU General Public License v3.0 or later
(GPL-3.0-or-later).


